--- !u!114 &3901503840622434160
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 719333084683614569}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2efde7e9e75a7e747817347127bcb875, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TextTreeChooser
  PossibleSequencesMorale: []
  PossibleSequencesKnightHealth: []
  PossibleSequencesCurrentDay:
  - DialogueTree:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1.5
      Line: There is my special bubba, who is a good boy?
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c999fc6f85824e147a0cd66eb210482f, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: Yes you are! Yes you are!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: "I\u2019m so happy to see you! I have so many activities planned, I-"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49d5ada2fd17c884caf29537df14a9fd, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Huh? How did I know shiny was sick?
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0457ef8882733244885214b1de98c91, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 5
      Line: Um, well...
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 2.5
      Line: You know... how I... uh... Straight to the point, what a pain :(
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'Oh, you are too smart a cookie, my sweet. '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'Do you remember when you accidentally bought me poison ivy for my night
        night spell, pet? '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Well, I saw how sad you were to be a bad boy, so I made sure to use it
        for something very important.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0457ef8882733244885214b1de98c91, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: "In fact, it turned out to be a blessing in disguise! I\u2019m so proud
        of you, bubba :)"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 2
      Line: That ivy gave me the most fabulous idea for how to get rid of that buzzkill
        for good!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: Forever... ;)
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'Please, hold your applause! '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: "...okay, don\u2019t hold it. Aren\u2019t I the greatest, most powerful
        witch in the woods?"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 2
      Line: "Hey, what\u2019s that mean look for :("
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 49296a8c99898f54cb1594373a036846, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Look, I know you like the tin can. I did too, once... before I knew better
        :/
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: But it's for the best. Severing our... personal ties was the second best
        thing I have ever done, first being taking you in of course <3
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: Best get the knight out of my professional life too... so I can finally
        invade that insolent little village and expand my magical territory.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: "Okay, I know you like that puny town too, but there\u2019s no need to
        bark- "
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: "The townspeople? Who cares about them? I\u2019ll probably just add them
        to my army."
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: "You know what, you\u2019re being so ungrateful for all of the work I
        put in to my brilliant evil plan bubba!!"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: "You\u2019re being a very bad boy!"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8f4cf9fc92d8d474a832248a18048d6d, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: ...
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd3e8ea5a61f2124ab5bd38d4210a117, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: "I\u2019m sorry... let\u2019s just..."
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 0}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: The witch sighs, rubbing between his eyes.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 2
      Line: "I\u2019ll... leave you alone for now. Just think about it, okay?"
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: "This IS a good thing. You\u2019ll see."
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    townMoraleThreshold: 0
    knightHealthThreshold: 0
    currentDayThreshold: 2
  - DialogueTree:
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: Okay, I know you're upset, bubba.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f002ec0f847451742ad27eae8dd44050, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: I'm just the worst papa ever :(  I was just trying to do something nice
        for you </3
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'And I- '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd3e8ea5a61f2124ab5bd38d4210a117, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'Huh? Why don''t you look mad anymore?? You look so... '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd3e8ea5a61f2124ab5bd38d4210a117, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: Stop making that sad sound! You're making me feel guilty!
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd3e8ea5a61f2124ab5bd38d4210a117, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 0.5
      Line: Don't you dare cry like that again! I-
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: dd3e8ea5a61f2124ab5bd38d4210a117, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: 'I never wanted to cause you so much pain. But that stupid knight made
        me so angry, always beating up my minions and- '
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: ...Sorry, I've been selfish. I just wanted to you all to myself, my special
        little guy. I've never been very good at sharing.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: I never considered what you wanted. I messed everything up :'(
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 3
      Line: If you leave now, I promise I won't bother you two again </3
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 8300000, guid: b0457ef8882733244885214b1de98c91, type: 3}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: There are plenty of forests where I can build my evil army where it's...
        less complicated.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    - Speaker: {fileID: 965250240303679006}
      TextSpeed: 1
      Line: I've already done enough damage here.
      DogSoundEffect: {fileID: 0}
    townMoraleThreshold: 0
    knightHealthThreshold: 0
    currentDayThreshold: 5
